              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu yuma yapupiluwu yaditulili muyuma yadiiluwu ayilobu ayili kunjita, yashi kili munyikoku makombakaji makulakaji atanu nadimu, namakombakaji makumi atanu nayedi, namakombakaji atanu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
