        {
          "text": "kwoku kuchibalu chawanyana kaIsarela Mosi welili hamakumi atanufumishahu wumu, hamakumi atanu afumishahu wumu, niantu nianyama, wenkeli aLevi atalilaŋa mudimu watabanaka yaYehova, mwomwalejelu wuMosi kudi Yehova.",
