              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akulumpi akunjikiluwu kutala makombakaji anjita, wowu anyanta amakombakaji, nawanyanta amakulakaji, aswilili kwakwihi naMosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
